// Pocket Singularity

@0 = ~Pocket Singularity~
@1 = ~Pocket Singularity~

@10 = ~What looks like a black orb from afar is actually a transportable portal into a nondimensional space. Not much is known about its nature since the maker of this curious device has long been forgotten by time.

However, by using a specific gesture with your left hand the orb comes to life and opens a small portal into another space. Regardless of what is put into this item, the orb always weighs a fixed amount.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 5~
